    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Descent is a rogue-lite, action, wave-based survival game with some meta progression. You will make your way through waves of enemies until a boss spawns. Defeat that boss, and you can move on to the next level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Create your own builds</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different automatically used weapons to select from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Supports that change the way the weapons work and upgrade the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed abilities that you activate on command to get out of sticky situations or press the advantage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Battle deadly bosses</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each level, there is a boss to defeat in order to unlock the next level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Upgrade between runs</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using souls collected through your journey, upgrade yourself for the next and future runs.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Descent is a rogue-lite, action, wave-based survival game with some meta progression. You will make your way through waves of enemies until a boss spawns. Defeat that boss, and you can move on to the next level.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Create your own builds</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple different automatically used weapons to select from.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Supports that change the way the weapons work and upgrade the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timed abilities that you activate on command to get out of sticky situations or press the advantage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Battle deadly bosses</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each level, there is a boss to defeat in order to unlock the next level.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Upgrade between runs</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using souls collected through your journey, upgrade yourself for the next and future runs.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A very casual approach to the survivor-like genre. Trudge through the onslaught of foes with your own customized builds of automatically firing weapons, self-activated abilities, and scaling up with powerful synergies, all the while garnering lost souls to empower yourself for the next run.",
